   I was doing pretty well in the Gnomish mines with my Valkyrie, with
good enchanted long sword and shield.  Then I came up to an unknown
scroll.  I read it:
 
   What monsters do you wish to genocide [type the name] : Master Lich
 
   I found out it was a CURSED scroll of genocide.  This was a very 
slow and painful death because I had cold resistance - they didn't hurt
me, but within 1 round all major items I had were cursed.  I had a ring
of conflict on me, too, but I couldn't put it on - my sword and shield 
were cursed and it said I didn't have a spare hand.
 
   I had to wait for a passing Grey Elf to mind its way through the Master
Lich's to toast me.  I was trapped.
 
   I'll be a bit more careful with scrolls in the future.
